   $q$What does the narrator think about the trip in the first paragraph?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It will be too far away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It will be scary and dark.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It will be exciting and fun.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-part"},{"text":"It will be very boring.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It will be very boring.$q$, $q$The narrator says, "I was sure it would be the most boring trip ever." The narrator only starts to enjoy the trip later, after the slates and the bell.$q$, 'draft', 'ae9178c1-0297-5794-aec0-7feb929d6d72')
